  "description": "A close and dangerous cohabitation with the cult leader's son has begun!\n\nChung-A was swindled by her uncle who she trusted and her parents disappeared, saying they are chasing their missing uncle, and Chung-A suddenly begins living on her own. But it wasn't just Chung-A's family that was scammed! The biggest cult in the autonomous district, \"Millennium Adventist,\" was also deceived by her uncle. And Yo-Han, the son of the cult leader, came to Chung-A's house. He's dragging his luggage in...! God, is this cohabitation gonna be okay?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)\n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
